    "body": "This seems fine to me, although it seems surprising it wouldn't be supported anywhere. This is not too different from using an SVG `data:` URL in an `img` element for instance.\r\n\r\nI think it would be okay to add parallel tests for non-support if the canvas harness is too frustrating, although I suspect @fserb probably knows how to get it working.",
