    "updated_at": "2024-03-04T08:23:50Z",
    "body": "Oh, very good point...  \r\n\r\nThere is actually already [a test](https://wpt.fyi/results/html/canvas/element/manual/imagebitmap/createImageBitmap-blob-invalidtype.html) for a similar case where a Blob with a `\"text/html\"` MIME type but actually containing a PNG image works fine. The same test with an SVG MIME also passes everywhere today.\r\n\r\nBut with the change it should throw because the MIME sniffing algo would return `\"image/svg+xml\"` without actually sniffing since it's an XML type.  \r\nThis means throwing on the type as I did here doesn't work...",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
