    "updated_at": "2024-11-19T01:03:51Z",
    "body": "> (I wish Workers could supports rendering SVGs with some simplified/restricted DOM or something...)\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, since they can include `<foreignObject>` I don't think it can be \"simple\". \r\n\r\n> I think it would be nice for this to stay in the spec including even for Worker contexts, so that maybe one day it's supported...\r\n\r\nI'd personally also like to see this implemented, but I don't think it's a good thing we have this discrepancy between implementations and the specs. \r\nWould be good if we could have some input from the various implementers as to their plans here. And if someone has access to the reasoning behind https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/c09f91b2ff9b32da19ac09f02b721688c8c33fa8 that might help too.",
